dsh-clipboard-tools README · Usage：Ask in plain language — "read the log I just copied", "put the install section on my clipboard", "copy the chart I just generated". The model calls:

```json
{ "name": "clipboard_read",  "arguments": { "format": "auto" } }
{ "name": "clipboard_write", "arguments": { "path": "dist/report.md" } }
{ "name": "clipboard_write", "arguments": { "imagePath": "charts/revenue.png" } }
```
